        "username": "Killswitch",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/killswitch/{size}/2116_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-10T15:33:00.000Z",
        "cooked": "<aside class=\"quote group-playtesters\" data-username=\"phantaskippy\">\n<div class=\"title\">\n<div class=\"quote-controls\"></div>\n<img loading=\"lazy\" alt=\"\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/phantaskippy/48/1897_2.png\" class=\"avatar\"> phantaskippy:</div>\n<blockquote>\n<p>But every time you destroyed a fowl and gained a favor she would deal 2 damage and gain one as well, but yeah it isn't well balanced for every villain.That could be a nice project to work on.</p>\n</blockquote>\n</aside>\n<p>Okay, let's say she has four fowl. You kill four of them, netting four favor. She backlashes four times, dealing four instances of 2 damage. She only gets one favor this way, but only assuming she hits more than one hero, per ROUND. It would end very quickly for Lillian.</p>",
