        "can_recover": false,
        "can_see_hidden_post": false,
        "can_wiki": false,
        "read": false,
        "user_title": null,
        "bookmarked": false,
        "raw": "If favor is involved, I would probably make it so when hereos get a multiple of 20 then they each put the top card of their deck into play or into their hands, and when the villain get a multiple of 20 then put the top card of the highest HP villain's deck and the top card of the environment deck into play.  Also, for balance purposes, if favor is reduced below a milestone that was already hit, the reward is not given again when it goes back up.\r\n\r\nI also wanted to note that some existing villain + environment combinations are already rather unbalanced.  I tried Akashbuta on Final Wasteland once...  not planning to do that again.  My point is that it doesn't have to be balanced for all villains to be usable.",
