        "id": 131088,
        "name": "Arcanist Lupus",
        "username": "Arcanist_Lupus",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/arcanist_lupus/{size}/2169_2.png",
        "created_at": "2015-02-10T19:34:40.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I definately want some sort of reward for favor. &nbsp;What kind of collosseum would it be without the adoring fans?</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I expect that adding the collosseum will make some villains easier, while others will become harder. &nbsp;That's not a bad thing, it just makes them different.</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I expect Matriarch would be much easier, but on the other hand, Iron Legacy would probably become much harder. &nbsp;Every villain would be different.</p>",
